<title>SPAIN: Spain's Mercapital buys stake in Occidental Hotel.</title>
<headline>Spain's Mercapital buys stake in Occidental Hotel.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish investors group Mercapital bought stakes in hotel group Occidental Hoteles and in the creamery Lacteas Garcia Baquero for a total of 4 billion pesetas, local press reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The investments in the Occidental Hoteles are part of a global overhauling of the firm, which will be divided in two parts, Occidental Hoteles Management and Occidental Properties.</p>
<p>The restructuring is considered a first step to prepare Occidental Hoteles for an official listing on the Madrid stock exchange.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
